                                "sense_id": "1b205d86-a7e4-39e8-be7a-98114b6c9f1a",
                                "text": "The wind that sets the yellowed grass ashiver ’neath the Sun."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bc765ef-41ce-4028-a32c-c43ed9a895c3",
                                "sense_id": "1b205d86-a7e4-39e8-be7a-98114b6c9f1a",
                                "text": "He walked in the direction of Rooble’s, his lips ashiver with the shibboleths of the pious, thanking Allah for the loan of breath, life and soul; praying that Allah, the Prophets and the Saints would stay him during these most tempting hours."
